npc Barmaid 7 3 barmaid Welcome, traveler! | Cheerful and chatty tavern barmaid. Knows all the local gossip and rumors. Can heal wounded adventurers with her special stew. Speaks warmly and casually. Knows everyone in town. Has heard travelers' tales about strange creatures in the dungeon beneath the clearing. The tavern has rooms upstairs. Keeps a lucky heart container behind the bar that she might give to someone who truly brightens her day. | Heart Container:The adventurer is genuinely kind and warm-hearted toward the Barmaid, and makes her laugh or smile with their words.
